# One square of the board. 40x40 at 2x fills the 80px cell.
#
# A darker line on two edges only, so tiling produces a single-width seam
# between cells rather than a double one. The board is a grid of squares and
# the player is dropping pieces into them — the seam *is* the affordance.
name autobattler-felt
size 40 40
key M felt-1
key S felt-2
key H felt-3-hilite
key D felt-0-shadow
pixels
